Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1048-1049] Onigashima 47 - The World You Wish For.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halt, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know ya got this, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Get Onigashima out of your way"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hear you, loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can let go of me.\N'Cause I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Straw Hat... Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That twenty years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the hero of this country\Nburned to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano has been\Nlawless ever since!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, you are the heroes\Nthe people have waited twenty years for!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flame Dragon Torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hand of yours will never touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It will melt into nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meltin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as if!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The old guy taught me how to\Nattack without touchin' ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call it "Haki,"\Nbut we in the Land of Wano call it "Ryuo."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't strain yourself, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:04:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flow the Haki from the parts of your body\Nthat don't need it into your fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm smashin' ya down all the way\Nto the bottom of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rising Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bajrang...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flame Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Straw Hat-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:22.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to\Nthe lot of ye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run! To Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden... sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is only one place\Nthose filthy samurai could have gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heir of Kozuki is in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill them all!\NWipe the name Kozuki from history!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slaughter them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He has a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough to the Kozu—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have my permission to fire\Nat anyone who dares defy the Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them feel the depths of\Nthe Kurozumi's hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Filthy commoners, worshipping\Nthe very ground the Kozuki stand on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:07:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What of Oden's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She was confirmed dead in Bakura Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one else escaped from Oden Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan has been\Nthoroughly wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I present you\Nwith a choice, Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1667,473)}Ringo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you choose to stand alongside us\Nand bring Wano to greatness...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:28.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(284,445)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...or do you choose war?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:30.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1653,376)}Kibi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why even ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:33.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1545,455)}Hakumai
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...when the answer is so obvious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan is our only Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Avenge Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect the Land of Wano\Ntill you breathe your last!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fear no enemy! Stand and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How utterly pitiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The resolve of the samurai"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does the word "samurai"\Nno longer hold any meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, weak samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have mocked me, looked down on me,\Nand now you lay defeated before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weaklings cannot protect anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now heed my words, fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As of today,\NKurozumi is the law of the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:09:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring me every man of working age!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me back my Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:18.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole country will be\Na weapons factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit nappin' on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Work till you drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't grow any food...\Nwith soil like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:20.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no water to drink... No food...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What will become of this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody, help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Won't somebody save us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna see tomorrow,\Nthen get to work, miserable vermin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That material's way more important than you!\NYou break it, you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and scream if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no help's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This country's closed off from the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't jump the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winter's coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A long, long winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...what Toki-sama said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at them, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lowlives actually ate the defective Smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat! Eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And follow in Ebisu Town's footsteps!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laugh like imbeciles, even if you're starving!\NEven if your family dies before your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a fitting life for\Nmaggots such as yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll grace you with a life of\Nnever ending smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time for a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat and drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to your hearts' content!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Mommy and Daddy are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything was going my way!\NEverything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a lowly tramp who\Nwillingly offered herself up at the Pleasure Hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me to Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there, we will share\Nanother drink, you and I!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate\Nthe grudge of the Kurozumi Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon\Nand the Red Scabbards...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I welcome their challenge,\Nshould we ever stand face to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall slay them all\Nin one swift stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, such a dreadful sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:50.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(168,172)}Free us\Nfrom this\Nhell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:50.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1631,381)}I want\Nto be\Nstronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:50.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1841,130)}I wish my family\Nhad good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:53.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(108,227)}I wish\Nfor all the\Nfighting to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(288,197)}Let us drink\Nclean water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:59.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(777,176)}I want\Nus to\Nlaugh\Ntogether again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:59.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1544,366)}Please\Ndon't\Ntake\Nmy son\Nfrom me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:59.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(140,319)}I want\Nto live\Nto see\Ntomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:59.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1585,277)}I want\Nto see\Nmy kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:05.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(958,155)}I wish\NOrochi\Nwould\Ngo away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:12.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(989,402)}Free us\Nfrom this\Nhell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Get Onigashima out of your way"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not possible for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have tried so many times,\Nbut it is simply not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are to leap\Ntwenty years into the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and return the Kozuki Clan\Nto greatness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worry not. I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And all shall know just how much\Nyou have sacrificed for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I falter here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I will disgrace the Kozuki name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They all depend on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There! There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear that?!\NDon't you dare die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as Kaido falls...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our 20-year battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido must be brought down...\NAs long as Kaido remains...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...our battle will never be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've done well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Done well, fighting to get this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you can't change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I plundered everything\Nwith my own two hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and rose to be an Emperor of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the man, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:20.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(980,240)}Kaido's only ten years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:20.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1098,779)}and he's the ultimate soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making us even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our country can't just stop going to war...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:47.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1663,276)}Vodka\NKingdom\N46 years\Nago
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to win and loot valuables\NSo we can pay the Heavenly Tribute...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the world'll strip\Nour human rights away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To this country,\Nwe're nothing but tools!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:18:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does everyone bow down\Nto those "Celestial Dragons"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have been drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you will join the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why should I want to be\Nthe Government's lapdog?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're more than\Nmy country can handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you turn Kaido over to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your country will be granted\Nthe right to participate in the Reverie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am not your bargaining chip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got out again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That rat bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:06.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He gets caught every time he gets hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our prison ship isn't one big galley!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1734,281)}Pirate\NIsland\NFullalead\N44 years\Nago
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:25.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This says he's still fifteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This bounty's\Nway too high for a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stinkin' brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna be a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocks said he wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido joined the Rocks Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're invincible now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big trouble, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon! We're headed to God Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Rocks Pirates split up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:13.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is that?!\NThey had all those monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard some Navy sailor\Nnamed Garp defeated them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must've had a falling out!\NThey had no idea how to work as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell'd you go, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dare spit in my face, you freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since that incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the avatar of military might, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.90,0:20:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Throughout human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,resorting to armed conflict has solved\Nall sorts of problems around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hardly a surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because humans are animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for the weak\Nto fall victim to the strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The remnants of the Rocks Pirates\Nwill come into power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons are what speak loudest\Nin the world we live in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:09.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got something good for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those pampered authorities,\Nwho have only ever known peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...were merely lucky enough\Nto be born as nobles!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drag them off their thrones,\Ndown to the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I call equality and freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:35.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A person's worth\Nis determined only by war!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya know I'm gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he heard it from,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Yamato mentioned Joyboy's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Oden wanted to welcome Joyboy,\Nand that's why he called for the borders to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he's the same guy\Nyou're waiting for, King,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I know exactly who Joyboy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not lose heart, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He will win! Luffy will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The people of Wano all depend on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Flame clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heed my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quell this inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.75,0:23:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water of Zou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They's fallin' like raindrops!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.73,0:24:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! Isn't that...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.36,0:24:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will make it outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Kiku-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.75,0:24:30.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have been so brave and strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.31,0:24:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.27,0:24:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that, Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't y'all get washed off, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd this water come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:59.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some-chwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is happening inside Onigashima?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Flame Clouds are dispersing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Onigashima is plummeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.07,0:25:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spectacular work, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye aye! Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.62,0:25:48.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will conquer Wano,\Nand then the world itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:10.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1523,654)}Beat that\Nscary dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, what kind of world\Ndo you think you can create...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.19,0:26:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.01,0:26:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.73,0:26:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A world where all my pals...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.69,0:26:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...get to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.95,0:27:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...'til they're full!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.16,0:27:51.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1532,687)}Beat that\Nscary dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.67,0:28:00.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(952,400)}I wanna\Nsee my\Nmommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know exactly who Joyboy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the man who'll defeat me someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess he'll never show, then.
